<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have hit a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum, killing four people and threatening humanitarian operations, while RSF forces have assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. New defections include the RSF counterintelligence chief, a commander and a group joining the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties within the conflict. Ethiopia has offered to host inclusive Sudan peace talks and proposes a national unity government. The war produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNc2c5YVR5ejB2ZlN3RC1wNXVoSUtmc3hsems4MnJDN0pZeWpXaGhEcl96QTVCb3pzNlpoaGhxZVh0OHg2UUw5cnFkSHh2MGpxNklzTGtCZE5Cd2FvUnFJT1ctVTdOZjhOMG9JQ2JkdDRIdkNpR05WQjdUMmRQUVowdmFqaWdFdVdSbENkWUI4ZURmMFpXVEFTbFVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQMHNKQVl4SGhsSG1uWkhKSlBBMzRTWmtMQ2k2aVBERTMycUlnYWRwQzhtQ0Q0UnpmM3NmUjNjd3d6WVJ5eHBVOUpERHpTZFJyamZqZ2ttRldBZ1pTZ3BoakpzM1liNXBtTVRXSXVmN2dwYlZEZnNBajUzcFZSTGl6eE05ZlZOSGFCZGgydm00YWNlQXRiVU5meVhNYUsyR29GUHVlb0p6SDlQU3AxQzd0V01yaHJ1WGoz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Emirates 24|7&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5GblFIdnhBcHNwMTNBWmhpRERwUWx1X0R3MlBCcFlMdGUzY2VaajgtdnktRW9tV3pwbDFRQ2I0b3ZrdUg4eWFxbjlLeUREUzU2?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE13WUhqUkxqajBWVjdzZEs3M3RTZGlhTDBCR1BTRm9LWlQ0M2pVRkpEbVFkTWl5T1BmMlJnd09UMFNWMGlGNnlScnRoTHMwQjBycDV5b0hBTE9BUDM1X2M5YUlPcEtxVkZqNDZSNHNBRWZBMjZyR3NZU3d5T0hVV1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.co